Description
Application for scanning and detecting QR codes from video files and webcam in real-time.

Features
•	🔍 QR code scanning from video files (MP4, AVI, MOV, MKV, FLV)
•	📹 Real-time webcam scanning
•	⏸️ Pause and resume playback
•	⚙️ Video preprocessing for improved detection
•	🎯 Search for specific QR code content
•	📊 Display of all detected QR codes

Installation and Launch
Option 1: Ready-to-use .exe file (Windows only)
1.	Download the dist folder from GitHub (link on exe file and last packages (for folder “build\ScanURQR!”) - https://disk.yandex.ru/d/csX_oRjkWGCx6Q  )
2.	Make sure ScanURQR.exe, libiconv.dll, and libzbar-64.dll are in the same folder
3.	Run ScanURQR.exe
Note: A console window may appear on first launch - this is normal.
Option 2: Run via Python
1.	Install Python 3.10 or higher
2.	Install dependencies:
pip install -r requirements.txt
3.	Run the application:
python main.py

Usage Instructions
1. Launch the Application
Open the application - Enter search parameter (optional)
2. Select Operating Mode
Video Mode:
1.	Click "Выбрать видео" (Select Video) button
2.	Choose a video file on your computer
3.	Click "СТАРТ!!!" (START!!!)
Webcam Mode:
1.	Select the "Веб-камера" (Webcam) radio button
2.	Click "СТАРТ!!!" (START!!!)
3. Playback Controls
•	СТАРТ!!! - start video processing
•	ПАУЗА - pause processing (video stops but doesn't close)
•	ПРОДОЛЖИТЬ - resume processing from the pause point
4. Settings
Video Preprocessing:
•	Enable the toggle for improved detection on complex videos
•	Applies filters (grayscale, blur, thresholding)
Frame Skip:
•	Use the slider to adjust frame checking frequency
•	Value 2 = check every 2nd frame (faster)
•	Value 10 = check every 10th frame (slower, but more accurate)
5. Results
All detected QR codes are displayed in the list at the bottom
If a search parameter is specified, the application will show "Найден!!!" (Found!!!) or "Не найден!!!" (Not found!!!)
6. Exit
•	Press "q" on the video window to stop
•	Or close the video window with the X button
•	The application will return to the main window

Requirements
•	OS: Windows 10/11
•	Python: 3.10+
•	RAM: minimum 4 GB
•	Camera: for webcam mode

Troubleshooting
1.	Video doesn't display in .exe version:
Make sure DLL files (libiconv.dll, libzbar-64.dll) are located next to the .exe
2.	QR codes are not detected:
•	Enable "Video Preprocessing"
•	Decrease the "Frame Skip" value
•	Make sure the QR code is well-lit and in focus
3.	Application runs slowly:
•	Increase the "Frame Skip" value
•	Disable video preprocessing
